{
  "bookId": "hero-212018",
  "id": "bond-28598",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28598001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "金子！是金子！好多好多金子！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28598002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "我不是在做梦吧？！快掐我一把，告诉我这不是梦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28598004",
              "text": "这不是梦哦。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "28598004",
              "text": "是送给你的。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28598003",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28598004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "哇，居然还用黄金打造了龙之巢穴！\n嘿，中间的那个位置，我要摆上自己最爱的金苹果~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28598005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "老实交代，准备这个礼物，你一定花了很多钱吧？太浪费了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28598007",
              "text": "镀金的啦，不会很贵。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28598006",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28598007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "这么说……这座黄金巢穴原本只是普通的手办屋，只有表面一层全是金子？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28598008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "如果把外面这层金箔取下来，能打造多少金币啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "28598010",
              "text": "停，不要打这座手办屋的主意。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "28598009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28598010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "菈冬",
          "text": "嘿，我开玩笑的啦。你送的东西，我可不忍心破坏~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "28598",
